        "created_at": "2015-09-16T19:18:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p><span>Well we do know two, Legacy and Young Legacy's both happen at the same time in different timelines, &nbsp;both are killed by Baron Blade in the MaRs base, Legacy's leads to the timeline where Young Legacy takes on the mantle of Legacy, Young Legacy's leads to Iron Legacy.</span></p><p><span>Thanks to Iron Legacy putting both Legacys in hospital though neither of these timelines happen.</span></p>",
