        "created_at": "2015-09-16T20:25:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Is it correct that every piece of art on a SotM card originated in a Sentinels Comic (or would have originated in a Sentinels Comic if they actually existed?)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Of course, if they're pulling from cover art as well then they could possibly use scenes that never actually occured in story.</p>",
