        "created_at": "2015-09-16T23:04:10.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Shame that there is not more info for some of the artwork on the cards. Some make me really curious about what&nbsp;happened. On the other&nbsp;hand it makes the characters more interesting and makes me fantasise about what happened to them. So thats a really cool aspect of it. Plus the gameplay is great :)</p>",
